                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Draft of Telegram To Be Sent by the War Department to General Eisenhower
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <p>“I am today appointing Mr. Murphy to be my personal representative in North
                    Africa with the rank of Minister. He will continue on General Eisenhower’s staff
                    in his present capacity as Civil Affairs Officer until such a time as
                    consultation with the War Department suggests a change.</p>
                <p>“The British Government is being informed in the above sense today.”</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1942-12-15"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >December</hi> 15, 1942</date>.</dateline></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
